{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/739128014cc3c9193e576cca1d3fa847.avif?t=1768076168\" width=618 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in solo or team up with up to 8 players in co-op. Host your own session or join others through the in-game lobby, using built-in voice and text chat to stay connected as you take on the rush. <br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.poster.avif?t=1768076168\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.webm?t=1768076168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.mp4?t=1768076168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run every part of a bustling fast food kitchen, from operating fryers and soda fountains to flipping burgers on the grill. Learn the ins and outs of each station to keep things running smoothly.  <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.poster.avif?t=1768076168\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.webm?t=1768076168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.mp4?t=1768076168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected: chaotic events, strange customers, and surprise challenges demand quick thinking and solid teamwork. Communication and coordination are your tools for success. <br>    <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.poster.avif?t=1768076168\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.webm?t=1768076168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.mp4?t=1768076168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp and manage your time wisely. Keep orders flowing and customers happy by assigning roles, juggling priorities, and working as one unstoppable crew. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.poster.avif?t=1768076168\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.webm?t=1768076168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.mp4?t=1768076168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3804930?t=1768076168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/9197914ea5cd143ade7e93b9ef1f6ea9ac72d3e0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768076168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps